Apotheosis Integration

Purpose

Apotheosis is an advanced equipment, enchanting, affix, and progression system.

Its systems should expand character progression without replacing the main technological and magical progression.

Apotheosis should become increasingly powerful as the player advances through the pack.

Progression Role

Apotheosis should primarily provide:

Advanced enchanting

Affix equipment

Boss encounters

Powerful equipment customization

Late-game character progression

Exploration rewards

Endgame equipment optimization

Apotheosis should not provide unrestricted access to powerful equipment during early progression.

Apotheosis Unlock

Basic Apotheosis systems should become available after the player establishes the necessary early progression.

Advanced Apotheosis systems should be progressively gated.

Full Apotheosis access should require significant progression through the main pack.

Apotheosis should have meaningful milestones rather than a single unlock.

Enchanting Progression

Enchanting should progress alongside the technological and magical systems.

Early enchanting should remain relatively accessible.

Advanced enchanting should require increasingly advanced resources and infrastructure.

High-level enchanting should require:

Advanced materials

Rare resources

Specialized infrastructure

Progression-specific components

Appropriate technological or magical progression

Enchantment Levels

Higher enchantment levels should be progressively gated.

The player should not obtain extremely powerful enchantments immediately after entering the enchanting system.

High-level enchantments should require:

Advanced enchanting infrastructure

Rare resources

Progression milestones

Appropriate experience requirements

Affix Progression

Affixes should follow the overall equipment progression.

Early affixes should provide useful but controlled bonuses.

Higher affix tiers should require increasingly advanced progression.

The strongest affixes should be reserved for late-game and endgame equipment.

Affix rarity should not completely determine progression.

The strongest equipment should still require appropriate materials, crafting systems, and progression.

Boss Progression

Apotheosis bosses should be integrated into exploration and progression.

Boss encounters may provide:

Rare materials

Affix equipment

Progression components

Unique rewards

Access to advanced Apotheosis systems

Bosses should become progressively more difficult.

Advanced bosses should require appropriately advanced equipment and infrastructure.

Bosses should not become mandatory walls for the entire technological progression unless specifically designated as progression gates.

Exploration Integration

Apotheosis should encourage exploration.

Rare equipment, bosses, structures, and resources should provide reasons to explore the world.

Exploration rewards should become more valuable as progression advances.

Late-game Apotheosis content may require exploration of dangerous environments, structures, dimensions, or rare locations.

Equipment Progression

Apotheosis equipment should follow the general equipment progression.

Early equipment should remain accessible.

Advanced equipment should require increasingly powerful materials and systems.

Late-game equipment should require significant progression.

The strongest equipment should require resources from advanced technological, magical, or exploration systems.

Material Integration

Apotheosis recipes may use materials from the main progression.

Possible requirements include:

GregTech materials

Modern Industrialization materials

Mekanism materials

Create components

Magical resources

Exploration resources

Rare boss materials

These requirements should be used when they create meaningful progression connections.

They should not simply increase recipe costs.

Technology Integration

Apotheosis should benefit from technological infrastructure.

Advanced industrial systems may be required to produce components for high-tier equipment.

GregTech may provide advanced materials.

Modern Industrialization may provide specialized processing.

Mekanism may provide chemical processing.

Create may provide logistics and mechanical infrastructure.

AE2 may provide advanced storage and automation.

Technology should support Apotheosis without making magical or combat progression irrelevant.

Magic Integration

Apotheosis should interact with the magic progression where appropriate.

Magical resources may be required for advanced enchanting or equipment.

Magical systems may provide specialized components for high-level Apotheosis progression.

Apotheosis should remain distinct from the main magic progression.

Neither system should completely replace the other.

Enchanting Infrastructure

Advanced enchanting should require increasingly sophisticated infrastructure.

The player should progress from basic enchanting toward advanced Apotheosis systems through:

Improved enchanting structures

Better resource production

Higher-quality equipment

Advanced experience generation

Specialized materials

Late-game enchanting infrastructure

Enchanting should become an industrialized system at high progression levels.

Automation

Advanced Apotheosis systems may eventually become highly automated.

Automation may include:

Experience generation

Material production

Equipment processing

Enchanting support

Loot management

Affix management

AE2 may be used to manage large-scale equipment and resource logistics.

Automation should reduce repetitive work without removing the progression requirements.

Progression Gates

Apotheosis progression should contain clear gates.

Possible gates include:

Technological tiers

Magical progression

Boss progression

Exploration milestones

Rare materials

Advanced equipment

Specialized machines

These gates should prevent early access to the strongest Apotheosis systems.

Late-Game Unlocks

Late-game Apotheosis systems should introduce powerful equipment customization.

Possible late-game systems include:

High-tier affixes

Advanced enchantments

Powerful equipment

Rare boss rewards

Specialized equipment optimization

High-level enchanting infrastructure

Late-game Apotheosis should become a significant character progression system.

Full Apotheosis Access

Full Apotheosis access should only become available after substantial progression.

The player should have:

Advanced technological infrastructure

Advanced magical infrastructure

Access to rare resources

Strong equipment

Reliable automation

Advanced exploration capabilities

The exact requirements will be defined during recipe and progression implementation.

Quest Integration

Apotheosis should have dedicated quests.

Quests should introduce:

Basic enchanting

Advanced enchanting

Affixes

Bosses

Equipment progression

Exploration

Late-game systems

Full Apotheosis progression

Quest rewards should support progression without providing major shortcuts.

GuideME Integration

GuideME should document the Apotheosis systems.

Documentation should explain:

Enchanting

Affixes

Equipment progression

Boss mechanics

Progression gates

Important resources

Advanced systems

Late-game unlocks

The quest system should provide objectives while GuideME provides detailed reference information.

Endgame Apotheosis

Apotheosis should remain relevant during the late game and post-endgame.

Endgame Apotheosis may focus on:

Extremely powerful equipment

Maximum enchantment progression

Advanced affixes

Rare boss rewards

Extreme equipment optimization

Integration with endgame technology and magic

Apotheosis should provide meaningful character progression without replacing ProjectE or Avaritia as final progression systems.

Progression Integrity

Apotheosis must not bypass the main progression.

It must not provide unrestricted early access to:

High-tier materials

Advanced machines

Extreme power systems

ProjectE

Avaritia

Other final progression systems

Apotheosis should enhance the player's capabilities while respecting the progression of the entire pack.

Final Goal

Apotheosis should transform equipment progression into a long-term system.

The player should begin with basic equipment, gradually gain access to stronger enchantments and affixes, defeat increasingly powerful bosses, explore increasingly dangerous areas, and eventually reach extremely advanced equipment optimization.

Apotheosis should remain valuable from mid-game through post-endgame without invalidating the technological, magical, or industrial progression.
